ates of Pugmire,</i> <i>They Came From Beyond the Grave!, </i><i>TC Aeon: Mission Statements</i>, <i>TC In Media Res,</i> <i>DtD Night Horrors: Enemy Action,</i> <i>C20 Anthology of Dreams</i><br /> Masculine pronouns preferred.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/309-white-oak-dragon","name":"White Oak Dragon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar309_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-14T20:20:10-07:00","id":931778,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>espritdecalmar</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/912922-recruitment-city-of-fear?p=931019#post931019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You can if you like. I would say don't worry giving him a full character sheet, just the most interesting bits--unless there's something really burning inside you to do so.<br /> <br /> Sorry for my radio silence the past few days: I got tied up with some stuff, and then I got distracted wandering around various parks and streets hunting imaginary monsters.</div> </div> </div> </div>He lives ...again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Crunch isn't a hobby; it's a calling.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1959-hexmeister-vic","name":"Hexmeister Vic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1959_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"764"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T07:40:29-07:00","id":933413,"title":"","content":"And this disappearance one was for a more tangible reason: My apartment's internet was shut off because of a misunderstanding with my ISP regarding my request to transfer service. Apparently &quot;I want my service transferred in August&quot; means &quot;I want my service canceled in the middle of July.&quot; (For a telecommunications company they sure are poor at communication!!!!!!!!!! #ohbutyougottalaugh)<br /> <br /> I'm currently typing this at a trendy cafe (pretend there's an accent aigu over that e; I'm no UKer) and reading the Wikipedia entry on Bachelor's Grove Cemetery. I'm about to go read your excellent roleplay and see how to go from there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T08:52:38-07:00","id":933437,"title":"","content":"Okay, this looks fantastic. Avernian Gates, orbs, mysterious angel statues. . . I'll let you guys go as far as you want on that thread before starting things off. It'll be a Monday morning in June.<br /> <br /> I might have some more questions relating to this graveyard rendezvous later, to tie things together.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-18T10:17:28-07:00","id":933470,"title":"","content":"Unless Sellers decides to drop another angel statue on us I think we're probably close to done. :P Besides, I imagine everyone else is getting antsy to start. Worst case we can run what's left of that scene parallel to the beginning. I know Samuel's going to spend the next pose or two trying to process that Nathaniel is a magician with a Rabbit horror and then he'll probably be on his way before the sun comes up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-07-24T10:06:56-07:00","id":936598,"title":"","content":"Good morning. The introduction to Chapter One is now ready to be viewed and reacted to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T09:26:38-07:00","id":942005,"title":"","content":"So most of us have done our morning posts, do we know when we're moving forward? If not can we do more short scenes like me and Hargrove did just so we can keep things going?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T15:42:02-07:00","id":942283,"title":"","content":"Sorry guys- been away from reliable WiFi for a bit. I'm up in the mountains on a family vacation. I'll be able to post Thursday night.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T06:37:42-07:00","id":947721,"title":"","content":"Hey, no problem man. I was just trying to get permission for us to start another impromptu scene in the mean time. I'm sure people are itching to play their characters. <br /> <br /> Calmar - Can we run another scene in the interim? I'm sure Elias and Michael wouldn't mind having an excuse to play (you guys are connected somehow right?) since me and Hargrove got one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T07:39:27-07:00","id":947759,"title":"","content":"Phew- finally posted. That took way too long to get out. Been super busy settling back in to regular life and my computer kept eating my responses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1127694-arcanist-s-homebrew-hub\" target=\"_blank\"><b>My Homebrew Hub</b></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4152-arcanist","name":"Arcanist","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T08:56:52-07:00","id":947809,"title":"","content":"Oh man, Dorian and Samuel are going to be intolerable together and it's going to be fantastic. I honestly don't know what will be worse for everyone in the room, when they disagree on something or they feel the need to observe one of the other members of the Brood. &quot;....stop looking at me like that.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T15:24:55-07:00","id":948112,"title":"","content":"That's an excellent post. I'm getting even more good ideas here.<br /> <br /> Okay, so, ah. Speaking of ideas, and posting.<br /> <br /> You may have noticed my lack of doing so. Lately things on my end have been one occurrence after another. I just moved into a new apartment, and I just got internet in said new apartment today. And tomorrow I fly to another state for a week, then driving back to my current state of residence just in time for work/school to begin anew (stopping, naturally, in a large city along the way as part and parcel of a ritual of emotional auto-flagellation I've decided to conduct for myself, and also to look at a whale shark).<br /> <br /> What I'm meaning to say here is that I have ideas for where this is all going, but it's going to take a while for those ideas to fulminate. I apologize for the wait, and for the fact that the wait is going to have to be a little longer. I appreciate your patience, I really do. I do think good things are going to happen here, especially if I am interpreting certain oracles correctly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T15:51:08-07:00","id":948140,"title":"","content":"Hey, we've all been there. Life gets in the way. I think we're all looking forward to getting this off the ground. Let us know if we can do some vignettes, minor scenes where the characters interact (and don't really accomplish anything) just so we can keep people invested until you have some time to get things up and moving. That way we all get to play with the characters and get a better feeling of how we want them to behave ahead of getting the story moving. I know I really appreciated my scene with hargrove, but not everyone's had that chance yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-10T16:36:19-07:00","id":948169,"title":"","content":"If you want to do vignettes, memories of the past, etc, that sounds great to me. You could like set up your own preludes so you get a feel for how you want to play your characters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-11T05:27:45-07:00","id":948529,"title":"","content":"Awesome, thanks for that. It gives us something to mess around with and a reason to stay active while we pass the time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10415-vermillionde","name":"VermillionDe","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"69"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}